config TEGRA_AVP_STAGING
	tristate "NVIDIA Tegra20 AVP multimedia offload"
	depends on ARCH_TEGRA_2x_SOC || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on TEGRA_HOST1X
	select FW_LOADER
	select SRAM
	help
	  Interfaces of the NVIDIA/Android 2.6.39 and L4T trees used by the
	  NVIDIA (L4T) multimedia libraries to run codecs on the Tegra20 AVP
	  coprocessor: /dev/tegra_avp, /dev/tegra_rpc, /dev/tegra_sema,
	  /dev/nvmap, /dev/knvmap and /dev/nvhost-ctrl. The AVP drives the
	  VDE, so the tegra-vde driver must not be bound at the same time.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the module will
	  be called tegra-avp.
